      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一支箭不能战胜的对手。\n但是，有两支箭的话获胜的概率就会上升。\n一般来说是这样的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6fcbb0b27fe949955e2aadae179261d573a9ab3254cefaa307ad5a34066d584",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
